# Morrowind Daedric quests: Mehrunes Dagon's Razor (DA_Mehrunes). Mehrunes Dagon's statue in Yasammidan speaks and
# sets the quest (10), then asks whether the player will prove their worth: "I wish to prove my worth." (button 0)
# sends them for the Razor in the Alas Ancestral Tomb (20). Carrying the rusty dagger back within 800 units of the
# statue logs 30, and the statue reforges it as Mehrunes' Razor (40).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel, removeallitems for Take All on Varner Hleras's corpse. FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's
# slot 05: 052B9EE2 Mehrunes Dagon's statue, 05CAF66F the corpse.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_da_molagbal_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case da_mehrunes_start
run
player->PositionCell -2064 3850 -1155 0 "Yasammidan, Shrine"
wait 120
activate 052B9EE2
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Mehrunes == 20
end

case da_mehrunes_razor
run
player->PositionCell 1018 850 86 0 "Alas Ancestral Tomb"
until 600 "contain_dead_mehrunes00"->GetDistance player < 1000
wait 60
activate 05CAF66F
wait 60
close ContainerMenu
console 05CAF66F.removeallitems player
until 120 player->GetItemCount Rusty_Dagger_UNIQUE >= 1
end

case da_mehrunes_done
run
player->PositionCell -2064 3850 -1155 0 "Yasammidan, Shrine"
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Mehrunes == 30
activate 052B9EE2
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Mehrunes == 40
expect player->GetItemCount "mehrunes'_razor_unique" == 1
end
